**300-character description**
```
Python script that plots multi-sample FTIR transmission or absorbance spectra from an Excel file as an interactive Plotly chart. Automatically converts transmission to absorbance if selected. Saves outputs as HTML and Excel. Requires pandas, numpy, and plotly.
